    "body": "Hi there !\r\nWe over at StageX package Cython. We do so fully deterministic.\r\nIn our last release we had to apply the patch as seen below because the inference sorting made it non-deterministic.\r\n\r\nI would appreciate an inclusion into cython.\r\n\r\nHere you may find the original creation:\r\nhttps://codeberg.org/stagex/stagex/commit/b401ce579705870bc88ecec17ab36950bf21ff63\r\n\r\nBest!\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/cython/cython/issues/8002",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-01T22:05:35Z",
